\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. October to November came in under 90% of normal in 45 of those years, the most of any pair, and July to August in 32. In 2025, Feb-Mar came in at 16% on the middle of the grids, and in 2026 so far it came in at 4%. Every grid had its driest year in 2011, with grid 17506 and grid 17508 at 47%.</p>"}
